  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 NGA - Settlement Extents v4.1",
    "description": "This version supersedes the GRID3 NGA - Settlement Extents v4.0 . The following changes were made: Revision of block delineation methodology resulting in new block geometries. Removal of hamlets and edge-blocks with zero-building count Addition of airports to the block classifications and removal of es_class (extent size) from the attributes and classification. Dataset citation Center for Integrated Earth System Information (CIESIN), Columbia University. 2026. GRID3 NGA - Settlement Extents v4.1. New York: Columbia University. https://doi.org/10.7916/73v5-mq06. Accessed [DAY MONTH YEAR].",
